    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25184" root="صور" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيِّرٌ</span></b>  <i>Goodly in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُورَة</span> [i. e. <i>form</i> &amp;c.]; (Fr, S,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَارٌ</span></b> . (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شور</span>.) One says
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ صَيِّرٌ شَيِّرٌ</span> (Fr, S) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارٌ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَارٌ</span></b>  (TA ubi suprà)
<i>A man goodly in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صورة</span> [or <i>form</i> &amp;c.] <i>and in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارَة</span>
[i. e. <i>appearance</i> or <i>apparel</i> &amp;c.]. (Fr, S.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَيِّرٌ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شور</span>.]

